#: ../../frc-docs/source/docs/software/dashboards/advantagescope.rst:2
msgid "AdvantageScope"
msgstr "AdvantageScope"

#: ../../frc-docs/source/docs/software/dashboards/advantagescope.rst:4
msgid ""
"AdvantageScope is a data visualization tool for :ref:`NetworkTables "
"<docs/software/networktables/networktables-intro:What is NetworkTables>`, "
":ref:`WPILib data logs <docs/software/telemetry/datalog:On-Robot Telemetry "
"Recording Into Data Logs>`, and :ref:`Driver Station logs "
"<docs/software/driverstation/driver-station-log-viewer:Driver Station Log "
"File Viewer>`. It is a programmer's tool (rather than a competition "
"dashboard) and can be used to debug real or simulated robot code from a log "
"file or live over the network."
msgstr ""
"AdvantageScope é uma ferramenta de visualização de dados para "
":ref:`NetworkTables <docs/software/networktables/networktables-intro:What is"
" NetworkTables>`,  :ref:`logs da WPILib <docs/software/telemetry/datalog:On-"
"Robot Telemetry Recording Into Data Logs>`, e :ref:`logs da Driver Station "
"<docs/software/driverstation/driver-station-log-viewer:Driver Station Log "
"File Viewer>`. É uma ferramenta de programação(em contraste com uma "
"dashboard de competição) e pode ser usada para depurar código de robô real "
"ou simulado, de um arquivo de log ou ao vivo pela rede."

#: ../../frc-docs/source/docs/software/dashboards/advantagescope.rst:6
msgid ""
"In Visual Studio Code, press :kbd:`Ctrl+Shift+P` and type ``WPILib`` or "
"click the WPILib logo in the top right to launch the WPILib Command Palette."
" Select :guilabel:`Start Tool`, then select :guilabel:`AdvantageScope`. You "
"can also open any supported log file in AdvantageScope using a standard file"
" browser."
msgstr ""
"No Visual Studio Code, pressione :kbd:`Ctrl+Shift+P` e digite ``WPILib`` ou "
"clique na logo da WPILib no canto superior direito para iniciar a Paleta de "
"Comandos da WPILib. Selecione :guilabel:`Start Tool`, e então selecione "
":guilabel:`AdvantageScope`. Você também pode abrir qualquer arquivo de log "
"suportado no AdvantageScope usando um navegador de arquivos padrão."
